# TypeScript/JavaScript Testing

> Extends the common testing rule with TypeScript/JavaScript-specific content.

## E2E Testing

Use **Playwright** as the E2E testing framework for critical user flows.

## Review Support

- Use the **browser-use** subagent (or the Playwright MCP server) to run E2E flows.
